{"version":3,"kind":"Article","sha256":"022ea86465cbfae6f1a45bf4e4d8b390abae715ffb17d7a7923c2f1d32bbcc78","slug":"publish","location":"/guide/phase-5/publish.md","dependencies":[],"frontmatter":{"title":"Publish and Update Website","label":"lancarbon-phase5-publish","authors":[{"nameParsed":{"literal":"Haojie Dai","given":"Haojie","family":"Dai"},"name":"Haojie Dai","id":"contributors-Users\\HAOJIE~1\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\lancarbon-pages-build-6WYntt\\myst-generated-uid-0"}],"license":{"content":{"id":"CC-BY-4.0","url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/","name":"Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International","free":true,"CC":true}},"github":"https://github.com/Hao-jieDai/LanCarbon-Guide","keywords":["LanCarbon","Jupyter Book","MyST","Markdown"],"numbering":{"title":{"offset":1}},"exports":[{"format":"md","filename":"publish.md","url":"/LanCarbon-Guide/build/publish-3d2875c51f4a05ff0f83b28012f12db8.md"}]},"mdast":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"block","children":[{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":7,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"First publish","position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":7,"column":1}},"key":"nkbpR0xJzf"}],"identifier":"first-publish","label":"First publish","html_id":"first-publish","implicit":true,"key":"uwpM9VOcNV"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":9,"column":1},"end":{"line":9,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Build the Book successfully, open Publish, and confirm Git, GitHub CLI, account, build, repository and Pages all pass. Select Publish Website. LanCarbon downloads the connected publication branch into a temporary folder, replaces its website files with the saved _build/html output, adds .nojekyll, creates one Git commit and pushes it to the configured branch.","position":{"start":{"line":9,"column":1},"end":{"line":9,"column":1}},"key":"FTq3BR1fi7"}],"key":"hw0q2jFwH5"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":11,"column":1},"end":{"line":11,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"The local managed build and Book source stay unchanged. The temporary publishing folder is removed after success or failure. Publishing updates only the selected Book’s connected branch; it does not delete the repository or alter other branches.","position":{"start":{"line":11,"column":1},"end":{"line":11,"column":1}},"key":"EQr0blij7D"}],"key":"fyEzh7vBUH"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":1},"end":{"line":13,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Later updates","position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":1},"end":{"line":13,"column":1}},"key":"kttky9svjR"}],"identifier":"later-updates","label":"Later updates","html_id":"later-updates","implicit":true,"key":"JsrnwZYZzE"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":15,"column":1},"end":{"line":15,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"After editing, run Build again first, then select Update Website. If the built files changed, LanCarbon creates and pushes a new commit. If they are identical, no empty commit is created. The panel stores the verified commit and publication time and compares that commit with GitHub during later checks.","position":{"start":{"line":15,"column":1},"end":{"line":15,"column":1}},"key":"yK2oJ85kqH"}],"key":"Vj4rD4aOD6"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":17,"column":1},"end":{"line":17,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"GitHub Pages may need a short time to show a new commit. Open Repository to inspect the branch or Open Pages to view the public site. A failed clone, commit or push leaves the remote website at its previous successful revision and reports the failed step.","position":{"start":{"line":17,"column":1},"end":{"line":17,"column":1}},"key":"vWwTogxlzs"}],"key":"chIkGAWaQ3"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":21,"column":1},"end":{"line":21,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"首次发布","position":{"start":{"line":21,"column":1},"end":{"line":21,"column":1}},"key":"yeRpL16mvA"}],"identifier":"id","label":"首次发布","html_id":"id","implicit":true,"key":"ZWPorTM2I3"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":23,"column":1},"end":{"line":23,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"先成功 Build Book，再打开 Publish，确认 Git、GitHub CLI、账号、构建、仓库和 Pages 均通过。点击 Publish Website 后，LanCarbon 会把已连接的发布分支下载到临时目录，用保存的 _build/html 替换其中的网站文件，加入 .nojekyll，创建一次 Git 提交并推送到指定分支。","position":{"start":{"line":23,"column":1},"end":{"line":23,"column":1}},"key":"i8G9g88xWG"}],"key":"XZk3oaUEv4"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":25,"column":1},"end":{"line":25,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"本地受管理构建与 Book 源文件不会改变。无论成功或失败，临时发布目录都会清理。发布只更新当前 Book 连接的分支，不会删除仓库，也不会修改其他分支。","position":{"start":{"line":25,"column":1},"end":{"line":25,"column":1}},"key":"ZW3V8wPAJT"}],"key":"qQ2zkXJ8nM"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":27,"column":1},"end":{"line":27,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"后续更新","position":{"start":{"line":27,"column":1},"end":{"line":27,"column":1}},"key":"fG02jFp5q8"}],"identifier":"id","label":"后续更新","html_id":"id-1","implicit":true,"key":"FYPLh0ux3s"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":29,"column":1},"end":{"line":29,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"修改内容后先重新 Build，再点击 Update Website。构建文件有变化时，LanCarbon 会创建并推送新提交；内容完全相同时不会制造空提交。面板保存已核实的提交编号和发布时间，后续检查时会与 GitHub 上的分支进行比较。","position":{"start":{"line":29,"column":1},"end":{"line":29,"column":1}},"key":"mwqhOM0QTo"}],"key":"onPerLS5vl"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":31,"column":1},"end":{"line":31,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"GitHub Pages 显示新提交可能需要短暂时间。Open Repository 可检查分支，Open Pages 可打开公开网站。下载、提交或推送失败时，远端网站仍停留在上一次成功版本，面板会指出失败步骤。","position":{"start":{"line":31,"column":1},"end":{"line":31,"column":1}},"key":"zrGzlRHx27"}],"key":"F4VtDLm2iT"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start"